d. We could incorporate them as evidence against teamwork. So we have some negative info about A and D. Should we incorporate? Yes, we have those facts. So we can update evaluation: A unfriendly (bad for crew), D moody, loner (bad). So that adds evidence against them.\n\nThus we still favor C. Provide confidence maybe 75%. Provide tradeoffs, uncertainties.\n\nWe should also consider if any new info could change our mind: positive teamwork for A or D, or severe communication issues for C.\n\nThus produce final output."}
